The '''Kenari''' were a group of [[human]]s native to the planet [[Kenari]]. They spoke the language [[Kenari (language)|Kenari]]. They were described as having dark features and large, dark eyes.<ref name="Kassa" /> After large scale [[mining]] devastated Kenari, tribes of orphaned children<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|kenari|Kenari}}</ref> were the only Kenari to survive on world.<ref name="CGttSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> [[Cassian Jeron Andor]] was a Kenari who was adopted by [[Maarva Carassi Andor|Maarva Andor]] and [[Clem Andor]].<ref name="Episode 3">{{Andor|Reckoning (episode)}}</ref>

